# Getting started

Requirements: Linux or macOS, Node.js, and at least one [coding agent](/docs/agent-clients) (Pi, Codex, Claude Code, etc.).

**1.** Run:

```sh
npx @pontia/cli init
```

**2.** Follow the prompts to sign in to your Pontia account in the browser.

**3.** Open [app.pontia.dev](https://app.pontia.dev).

More: [Linux](/docs/platforms/linux) · [macOS](/docs/platforms/macos) · [Initialization](/docs/initialization) · [CLI](/docs/cli) · [Updates](/docs/updating)
